WEBVTT

00:13:26.918 --> 00:13:30.227
And yet, all of us have
this psychological immune system,

00:13:30.251 --> 00:13:32.725
this capacity to synthesize happiness,

00:13:32.749 --> 00:13:35.900
but some of us do this trick
better than others.

00:13:35.924 --> 00:13:39.957
And some situations allow anybody
to do it more effectively

00:13:39.981 --> 00:13:41.741
than other situations do.

00:13:43.321 --> 00:13:46.566
It turns out that freedom,

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.916
the ability to make up your mind
and change your mind,

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:52.093
is the friend of natural happiness,

00:13:52.117 --> 00:13:55.828
because it allows you to choose
among all those delicious futures

00:13:55.852 --> 00:13:58.202
and find the one
that you would most enjoy.

00:13:58.226 --> 00:13:59.978
But freedom to choose,